<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>NexusOmni Lab</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/gsap.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/ScrollTrigger.min.js"></script>

<style>
* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  padding-top: 64px;
  font-family: Inter, sans-serif;
  background: #0a0a0a;
  color: #fff;
  overflow-x: hidden;
}

/* TOP NAV */
nav {
  position: fixed;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  height: 64px;
  padding: 0 24px;
  background: rgba(10,10,10,0.78);
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  border-bottom: 1px solid #222;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  z-index: 1000;
}

.logo {
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.3px;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.nav-links {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 20px;
}

.nav-links a {
  color: #aaa;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
}

.nav-links a:hover {
  color: #fff;
}

section {
  min-height: 100vh;
  padding: 100px 20px;
  text-align: center;
  max-width: 900px;
  margin: auto;
}

h1 {
  font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 3.6rem);
  line-height: 1.1;
}

h2 {
  font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.4rem);
}

p {
  color: #aaa;
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.accent {
  color: #ff6a00;
}

.divider {
  height: 1px;
  background: #222;
}

.fade {
  opacity: 0;
  transform: translateY(40px);
}

canvas {
  width: 100%;
  height: 400px;
  margin-top: 30px;
  background: #111;
  border-radius: 12px;
}

video {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 800px;
  margin-top: 30px;
  border-radius: 12px;
}

.btn {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 20px;
  padding: 10px 20px;
  background: #ff6a00;
  color: #fff;
  text-decoration: none;
  border-radius: 6px;
}

/* MOBILE NAV */
@media (max-width: 600px) {
  nav {
    padding: 0 16px;
  }

  .nav-links {
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .nav-links a {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .logo {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<nav>
  <div class="logo">NexusOmni Lab</div>
  <div class="nav-links">
    <a href="#problem">Problem</a>
    <a href="#solution">Solution</a>
    <a href="#demo">Demo</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<section id="top">
  <h1 class="fade">Rebuilding Material Handling<br><span class="accent">with Intelligence</span></h1>
  <p class="fade">We are not building a warehouse.<br>We are proving a new control paradigm.</p>

  <canvas id="canvas"></canvas>
</section>

<div class="divider"></div>

<section id="problem">
  <h2 class="fade">Material handling is still <span class="accent">rule-based</span></h2>
  <p class="fade">Rigid PLC systems. Hard-coded logic.</p>
</section>

<div class="divider"></div>

<section id="solution">
  <h2 class="fade">AI control layer for logistics</h2>
  <p class="fade">Simulation → Learning → Real-world deployment</p>
  <p class="fade">Powered by <span class="accent">NVIDIA Omniverse</span></p>
</section>

<div class="divider"></div>

<section id="demo">
  <h2 class="fade">Real System Demo</h2>
  <p class="fade">Simulation to real-world</p>

  <video autoplay muted loop playsinline>
    <source src="demo.mp4" type="video/mp4">
  </video>
</section>

<div class="divider"></div>

<section>
  <h2 class="fade">Why Us</h2>
  <p class="fade">We come from the MHE world. We understand real systems.</p>
  <p class="fade"><span class="accent">This isn’t exploration. It’s execution.</span></p>
</section>

<div class="divider"></div>

<section>
  <h2 class="fade">Every conveyor becomes intelligent</h2>
  <p class="fade">Software-defined infrastructure. Continuous optimization.</p>
</section>

